# BYOC AWS test fixture — deterministic placeholder values for static QA.
# Consumed by hack/check-helm-values-templates.sh to render
# scripts/aws-setup/values-region.yaml.tmpl via envsubst, then helm template+lint.
# NOT real credentials — these strings match shape, not content.
